ria in Lent.</l><l xml:id="m-188d817f-6cae-4c7b-b14a-13436f1c6113" facs="#m-7d3d2478-72ef-4f48-af92-8b1e5577ccff" label="lyrics-like">Communion. Floréte flóres. p. 1677.</l><l xml:id="m-3f75688a-8690-4562-87b9-a42b8b467e12" facs="#m-6fe1fc08-6a68-4a1e-80ba-25d27d547f64" label="text-like">Commemoration of the Feria in Lent.</l><l xml:id="m-8a882657-d8ec-4393-a0d7-219399000f90" facs="#m-496445f0-3cde-4090-bd5d-18718898c5a1" label="ambiguous">Postcommunio</l><l xml:id="m-f3dca08b-a91d-4c7a-a8b1-f307caab80b7" facs="#m-0ff7b993-5b52-412a-96de-3a0dcef3a66f" label="lyrics-like">YAcris, Dómine, recreáti my-l stántiam aemulántes, patiéntiae</l><l xml:id="m-9f228e3f-7060-4206-ae46-0c4e7e56400b" facs="#m-927028c8-bf4d-483e-a037-ef3254699d80" label="lyrics-like">O stériis, quaésumus, ut miram! praémium cónsequi mereámur</l><l xml:id="m-c47faf2b-a0ae-4f52-833c-af10690c7c8b" facs="#m-f94568fe-3e9e-4b79-a43a-07913f5bee6e" label="lyrics-like">beátae Mariae Bernárdae con-l aetérnum. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-a13b9a74-8900-41ee-b367-3761c20ef2e6" facs="#m-0cbcc207-ae65-4bd7-9308-9dd550051727" label="text-like">AT VESPERS</l><l xml:id="m-cde8e8d1-53b2-41f0-9ce4-2209547ca92a" facs="#m-3fa0178c-549b-4a43-9ff9-2f807c4e345f" label="text-like">Ants. and pss. of the day occurring, pp. 280ff.; the rest from the</l><l xml:id="m-9eea01a4-a355-417a-824d-89b9616e27fb" facs="#m-a260e0a6-bd16-401d-beb7-b285bdeab69d" label="ambiguous">Common, p. 1211, except:</l><l xml:id="m-0f61e796-96d0-4a4e-86b4-e26a32031d80" facs="#m-0f06c28d-4e8a-4da3-85fd-357e744cb7c6" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-eb4fcf5b-0477-4149-aaed-debfada4b691" facs="#m-7bbcbb05-8492-4bf6-b11a-27525201b5f9" label="ambiguous">Ant. 8G</l><l xml:id="m-a41b8aa0-a840-469d-9a32-ad5e5cf60226" facs="#m-018646a5-cf06-43b9-abe0-9f3383b83933" label="ambiguous">W</l><l xml:id="m-83ca9611-1cee-4be4-92cf-d5d459806f4f" facs="#m-b96febe7-e5ad-4840-abd1-7088be09cbfe" label="lyrics-like">Rá-ti-as tí-bi á-go, "Virgo imma-cu-lá-ta</l><l xml:id="m-46b53fa2-260a-4078-a057-c16ad726edc0" facs="#m-97968c6f-4a4d-4d90-b680-239ccabc51e4" label="lyrics-like">Dé- i Má-ter, qui-a per ancil-lam tú-am pópu-lo</l><l xml:id="m-d3b11865-2456-4d42-af3d-c32e4489e54c" facs="#m-3b7c7ca0-25b0-4247-837e-0db8b6edb5fe" label="lyrics-like">et pá-cis pignora attu-lí-sti.</l><l xml:id="m-3506f664-4811-4a90-8dee-c17e72295cd6" facs="#m-8eadcb08-2f4d-42be-86c9-bcaf28aa3fab" label="lyrics-like">tú- vérba sa-lú-tis</l><l xml:id="m-85cfcd47-f2a7-48c7-a8b4-2b9c96efa37b" facs="#m-b297cfde-5dfd-469c-961e-33ee90d77db7" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-7a635711-023d-404d-94c0-5cb9fc5e606b" facs="#m-7503c810-26e6-4a14-8a96-830676f19704" label="text-like">Prayer. Humilium, Deus. p. (22).</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
